# Optional. Normally UNSET.
#
# In the single-origin production deploy (Express serves this client's build),
# leave this unset: the client then uses relative URLs and hits the same
# origin that served the page — no configuration required.
#
# Only set this if you ever split the deploy (client on a different host than
# the API), e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com/api/v1
#
# Dev fallback (also used when unset): http://localhost:8000/api/v1
# Do NOT commit a real .env — .gitignore already covers it.
